1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
What would it mean for an AI character to forget?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Memory is not just saved text.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
It also needs a cue that can reach it.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Forgetting might mean sinking deeper, not deletion.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The right person or place can bring it back.
